



>> CoffeeGrounds := 객체 새로.
CoffeeGrounds 받으면: ['extract'] 실행: { <- ['coffee']. }.

>> CoffeeMachine := 객체 새로.
CoffeeMachine 받으면: ['init'] 실행: {
	자기 coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds 새로.
}.
CoffeeMachine 받으면: ['새로'] 실행: { <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
}.

CoffeeMachine 받으면: ['makeTea'] 실행: { <- (자기 tealeaves extract). }.
CoffeeMachine 받으면: ['makeCoffee'] 실행: { <- (자기 coffeegrounds extract). }.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine 새로.

출력 쓰기:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

출력 쓰기:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
